4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The Royal Knights is an elite team of warriors chosen from only the most capable magic knights in all of the Clover Kingdom.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
And the selection exam was finally underway.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Asta, Mimosa Vermillion, and the mysterious mage who called himself Zerx Lubner were among the first to battle in the tournament.

7
