68
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:18,540
There's no need to train it. Such a thing is for the weak.

69
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:23,280
Well, yeah, I was pretty wimpy a long time ago.

70
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:25,840
It's hard not to be when you don't have any magic power.

71
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:27,860
That's why I worked so hard.

72
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:30,280
My muscles may be ugly, but they're my weapons.

73
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:38,380
We're born with a predetermined capacity for magic power, and that's that.

74
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:43,480
No matter what ugliness we stoop to in our struggle to change it, we can never do so.

75
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,280
Predetermined? I don't...

76
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,840
